output.json
indexed/
# ...and what `etherfold index --store sqlite` writes: a libSQL database file
# (plus the -wal / -shm SQLite leaves beside it) is indexed STATE, rebuildable
# from the chain, so it is never source
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

